      "bbox": {
        "l": 150.0,
        "t": 359.9469042,
        "r": 539.0418689549999,
        "b": 323.3795830865604
      },
      "content": "The parameters of the N5500 monitor are preset to 'Adult' monitoring mode.  Alarm limits  settings  will  be  automatically  changed  to  the  default  settings  for  each  patient mode as the mode is changed to Adult, Pediatric or Neonatal mode.",
