      "section": "4.4 Factory Default Settings",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 140.32386779785156,
        "t": 297.3421936035156,
        "r": 539.2906494140625,
        "b": 80.2667236328125
      },
      "markdown": "Table 12. Factory Default Settings for the N5500\n\n| Parameter                   | Factory Defaults   | Factory Defaults   | Factory Defaults   |\n|-----------------------------|--------------------|--------------------|--------------------|\n| Parameter                   | Adult              | Pediatric          | Neonatal           |\n| Monitoring Mode             | Adult              | Pediatric          | Neonatal           |\n| NIBP Initial Cuff Inflation | 180 mmHg           | 180 mmHg           | 120 mmHg           |\n| NIBP Auto Mode Interval     | OFF                | OFF                | OFF                |\n| NIBP SYS Alarm Upper Limits | 160 mmHg           | 120 mmHg           | 90 mmHg            |\n| NIBP SYS Alarm Lower Limits | 90 mmHg            | 70 mmHg            | 40 mmHg            |\n| NIBP DIA Alarm Upper Limits | 90 mmHg            | 70 mmHg            | 60 mmHg            |\n| NIBP DIA Alarm Lower Limits | 50 mmHg            | 40 mmHg            | 20 mmHg            |\n| NIBP MAP Alarm Upper Limits | 110 mmHg           | 90 mmHg            | 70 mmHg            |\n| NIBP MAP Alarm Lower Limits | 60 mmHg            | 50 mmHg            | 30 mmHg            |\n| ECG Size                    | 10.0 mm/mV         | 10.0 mm/mV         | 10.0 mm/mV         |\n| ECG Filter Mode             | Monitor            | Monitor            | Monitor            |\n| ECG Pacer Detect            | OFF                | OFF                | OFF                |\n| ECG Sweep Speed             | 25.0 mm/s          | 25.0 mm/s          | 25.0 mm/s          |",
      "title": "Table 12. Factory Default Settings for the N5500",
